{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And you shall take.</b> It is written 'from their hand,' and in another place 'from upon their palms' (Leviticus 8:28), and it is the same thing." "<b>ניחוח.</b> Doubling of the ḥet, and one who understands the sod of the soul of man will understand this." "<b>Fire-offering.</b> An adjective from the root אש, and in another place: מן האש (Numbers 18:9)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:07.766204560Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}